<title>UK: Rabobank adds 50 bln lire to 10-year fix/rev FRN.</title>
<headline>Rabobank adds 50 bln lire to 10-year fix/rev FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fixed/reverse FRN has been increased to 400 billion lire from 350 billion lire, lead manager Credito Italiano said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    400 BLN ITL   COUPON    *10 PCT    MATURITY    06.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST THREE YEARS THEN 19.5 PCT LESS (2 X 6M</p>
<p>		LIBOR)</p>
</text>
